Template: synaxe-archive-keyring-private/username
Type: string
Description: Private Synaxe archive username:
 Use the per-host username issued by the archive administrator.

Template: synaxe-archive-keyring-private/password
Type: password
Description: Private Synaxe archive password or Basic-auth token:
 The credential will be stored in a root-only APT auth.conf file.
 Bearer/OAuth tokens are not supported by this authentication mechanism.
